{"id": "61121", "title": "强制爱之糖果诱惑", "author": "年华似水", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 15, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61121.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／都市生活／未定／未定\r\n\r\n关键字：苏晨、肖南　强制爱系列　其他 \r\n\r\n一夜迷乱之后苏晨为了男友被迫承欢有著冰蓝眼眸的男人身下；\r\n\r\n当十年相知抵不过名利浮华，屈辱被动转为渐渐情动，他蓦然惊觉心早已偏离……\r\n\r\n但是爱总被误会蒙上阴影，一次次失望后他终于决定为自己好好活一次！\r\n\r\n“我不会放你走！想都别想！”蓝眸凶狠，掩不住深处情动。\r\n\r\n他仰头微笑：“如果追得上，我就不走。”\r\n\r\n雨过天晴，空气中飘著花香，延续到异国的追逐游戏是否就快结束？", "base": "files/article/html/61/61121", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8994923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8994924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "8994926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "8994929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8994931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8994933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8994936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8994937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "8994940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "8994942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "8994944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "8994946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "8994948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "8994950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75完结", "file": "8994952.html", "available": false}]}